{
  "cmd_full_name": "ecd describe-renewal-price",
  "cmd_name": "describe-renewal-price",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Queries the renewal price of a Wuying product",
  "description_zh": "查询无影商品的续费价格",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun ecd describe-renewal-price --biz-region-id cn-hangzhou --instance-id ecd-6ldllk9zxcpfhs0000 --resource-type Desktop --period-unit Month --period 1 --instance-ids ecd-6ldllk9zxcpfhs0000 --promotion-id youhuiquan_promotion_option_id_for_blank --reseller-owner-uid 1017457975738750 --api-version 2020-09-30 --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "GET|POST",
  "multi_version": true,
  "name": "DescribeRenewalPrice",
  "operation": {
    "action": "DescribeRenewalPrice",
    "api_style": "RPC",
    "api_version": "2020-09-30",
    "method": "POST",
    "operation_type": "read",
    "protocol": "HTTPS",
    "system_operation_type": "list",
    "url": ""
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "doc_required": true,
      "example": "cn-hangzhou",
      "help_en": "The region ID. You can call [DescribeRegions](~~DescribeRegions~~) to query the regions supported by Wuying Workspace",
      "help_zh": "地域ID。可以调用[DescribeRegions](~~DescribeRegions~~)获取无影云电脑支持的地域列表",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "region_id",
      "options": [
        "--biz-region-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "RegionId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "ecd-6ldllk9zxcpfhs****",
      "help_en": "The instance ID. The value depends on the resource type (ResourceType) for which you want to query the renewal price:\n\nIf `ResourceType` is set to `Desktop` (to query the renewal price of a cloud computer), set `InstanceId` to the cloud computer ID.\nIf `ResourceType` is set to `DesktopGroup` (to query the renewal price of a cloud computer pool), set `InstanceId` to the cloud computer pool ID.\nIf `ResourceType` is set to `Bandwidth` (to query the renewal price of premium Internet bandwidth), set `InstanceId` to the premium Internet bandwidth ID",
      "help_zh": "实例ID。具体传入的值取决于要查询续费价格的资源类型（ResourceType）：\n\n当`ResourceType`=`Desktop`时（即查询云电脑续费价格），`InstanceId`需要传入云电脑ID。\n参数`ResourceType`=`DesktopGroup`时（即查询云电脑池续费价格），`InstanceId`需要传入云电脑池ID。\n参数`ResourceType`=`Bandwidth`时（即查询公网精品带宽续费价格），`InstanceId`需要传入公网精品带宽ID",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "instance_id",
      "options": [
        "--instance-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "InstanceId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "Desktop",
      "help_en": "The resource type",
      "help_zh": "资源类型",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "resource_type",
      "options": [
        "--resource-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ResourceType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "Month",
      "help_en": "The unit of the renewal duration, which is the unit of the `Period` parameter",
      "help_zh": "续费时长的单位，即参数`Period`的单位",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "period_unit",
      "options": [
        "--period-unit"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PeriodUnit",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The renewal duration. Valid values of this parameter are determined by the value of `PeriodUnit`.\n\nIf `PeriodUnit` is set to `Month`, valid values are 1, 2, 3, and 6.\nIf `PeriodUnit` is set to `Year`, valid values are 1, 2, and 3.\n\nDefault value: 1",
      "help_zh": "续费时长。取值范围由参数`PeriodUnit`的值决定。\n\n`PeriodUnit`为`Month`时，取值范围为：1、2、3、6。\n`PeriodUnit`为`Year`时，取值范围为：1、2、3。\n\n默认值：1",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "period",
      "options": [
        "--period"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Period",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "element": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "help_en": "The instance IDs. The values depend on the resource type (ResourceType) for which you want to query the renewal price",
      "help_zh": "实例ID。具体传入的值取决于要查询续费价格的资源类型（ResourceType）",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "instance_ids",
      "options": [
        "--instance-ids"
      ],
      "param_style": "repeatList",
      "raw_name": "InstanceIds",
      "required": false,
      "type": "array"
    },
    {
      "example": "youhuiquan_promotion_option_id_for_blank",
      "help_en": "The promotion ID",
      "help_zh": "优惠活动ID",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "promotion_id",
      "options": [
        "--promotion-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PromotionId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1017457975738750",
      "help_en": "The user ID of the resource ownership user in reseller pattern. You do not need to specify this parameter in non-reseller pattern",
      "help_zh": "转售模式的资源归属用户ID，非转售模式无需填写该参数",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "reseller_owner_uid",
      "options": [
        "--reseller-owner-uid"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ResellerOwnerUid",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    }
  ],
